<title>USA: St Paul hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher than Thursday's close. Top $60.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs    59.50-60.00</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs    59.00-60.00</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs    58.00-59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3     270-280 lbs    57.00-58.00</p>
<p>US 2-4     280-290 lbs    56.00-57.00</p>
<p>US 3-4     290-300 lbs    55.00-56.00</p>
<p>Sows: $0.50 to 1.50 lower. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-500 lbs    47.00</p>
<p>	     500-700 lbs    48.00</p>
</text>
